{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111196","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111196/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111196/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111196/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111196","id":3480083782,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7Pbd1G","number":111196,"title":"[4.5b7-4.5.1] Rigged characters with \"Remove Immutable\" disabled and \"Use Retarget\" become mangled when saving","user":{"login":"Invertex","id":7742262,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NDIyNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7742262?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex","html_url":"https://github.com/Invertex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Invertex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-03T07:20:46Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T01:16:48Z","closed_at":"2025-10-03T13:05:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in 4.5b7 and onwards, including 4.5.1RC1. (tested all releases)\n-Works fine in 4.5b6 and earlier.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.rc1.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8129) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700KF (20 threads) - 63.79 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWe use a complex rig that has extra joints along the main limb chains to give more creative animation control. Our models used to work fine until **4.5b7**.\nThe issue stops happening if I either enable \"Remove Immutable\" on the root import settings (but we need that to ensure extra bones reset and blend proper), or stop using the Retargeting feature on the Rig options (which we also need).\n\nBefore and after saving in **4.5b7 or later**:\n<img width=\"350\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be983cb0-271d-46fe-b54d-c3e464a761af\" /><img width=\"350\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24e60c45-49d9-40c0-a70e-c0445ad5c5e6\" />\n\nMy guess is that it may be related to this change:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110095\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110145\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn the included project:\n\nSimply open the `/-Game/Amber_Test.tscn` and save the scene while in **4.5b6** or earlier. It saves fine. Then open the project in a later version and do the same, and it should become mangled.\n\nChanging either of the previously mentioned import settings on `Amber_Test.gltf` and then trying to save the scene again should show it working fine (need to reset the skeleton first if reusing the same project).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n--Removed as no longer needed and contains personal assets--\n","closed_by":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111196/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0